# This repository ships executable judges, and they are mirrored byte-for-byte
# from the engine repository (frank8ai/aer-runtime, action/validate_evidence.py).
# The only practical way to check that the mirror has not drifted is to compare
# git blob SHAs, which is a byte comparison -- so a checkout that rewrites CRLF
# makes an in-sync copy look drifted, and makes a real drift indistinguishable
# from a line-ending artefact. Pin every text file to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch files must keep CRLF if any are ever added.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
